{"name":"matrix3_trace_split_reconstruction","v":1,"source_hash":"5356ba53ca710413","lines":["K : Type u_1","inst✝ : Field K","r : ℕ","a b c : Fin r → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) K","h : ∀ (i j j' k k' i' : Fin 3), ∑ s, a s i j * b s j' k * c s k' i' = if j = j' ∧ k = k' ∧ i = i' then 1 else 0","z : Fin 3 × Fin 3 × Fin 3 → K","p : Fin 3 × Fin 3 × Fin 3","⊢ ∑ s, (a s *ᵥ fun j => ∑ k, ∑ i, c s k i * z (i, j, k)) p.1 * b s p.2.1 p.2.2 = z p","i j k : Fin 3","⊢ ∑ s, (a s *ᵥ fun j => ∑ k, ∑ i, c s k i * z (i, j, k)) (i, j, k).1 * b s (i, j, k).2.1 (i, j, k).2.2 = z (i, j, k)","⊢ ∑ s, (∑ j', a s i j' * ∑ k', ∑ i', c s k' i' * z (i', j', k')) * b s j k = z (i, j, k)","⊢ ∑ x, ∑ x_1, ∑ x_2, ∑ i_1, a x i x_1 * (c x x_2 i_1 * z (i_1, x_1, x_2)) * b x j k = z (i, j, k)","⊢ ∑ j', ∑ k', ∑ y, ∑ x, a x i j' * (c x k' y * z (y, j', k')) * b x j k = z (i, j, k)","| ∑ x, ∑ x_1, ∑ x_2, ∑ i_1, a x i x_1 * (c x x_2 i_1 * z (i_1, x_1, x_2)) * b x j k","i j k j' k' : Fin 3","| ∑ y, ∑ x, a x i j' * (c x k' y * z (y, j', k')) * b x j k","| ∑ y, ∑ x, ∑ x_1, ∑ i_1, a x i y * (c x x_1 i_1 * z (i_1, y, x_1)) * b x j k","| fun y => ∑ x, ∑ x_1, ∑ i_1, a x i y * (c x x_1 i_1 * z (i_1, y, x_1)) * b x j k","i j k j' : Fin 3","| ∑ x, ∑ x_1, ∑ i_1, a x i j' * (c x x_1 i_1 * z (i_1, j', x_1)) * b x j k","| ∑ y, ∑ x, ∑ i_1, a x i j' * (c x y i_1 * z (i_1, j', y)) * b x j k","| fun y => ∑ x, ∑ i_1, a x i j' * (c x y i_1 * z (i_1, j', y)) * b x j k","| ∑ x, ∑ i_1, a x i j' * (c x k' i_1 * z (i_1, j', k')) * b x j k","⊢ ∑ x, ∑ x_1, ∑ x_2, (if x = j ∧ k = x_1 ∧ i = x_2 then 1 else 0) * z (x_2, x, x_1) = z (i, j, k)","⊢ ∀ (s : Fin r) (j' k' i' : Fin 3),","    a s i j' * (c s k' i' * z (i', j', k')) * b s j k = a s i j' * b s j k * c s k' i' * z (i', j', k')","s✝ : Fin r","j'✝ k'✝ i'✝ : Fin 3","⊢ a s✝ i j'✝ * (c s✝ k'✝ i'✝ * z (i'✝, j'✝, k'✝)) * b s✝ j k = a s✝ i j'✝ * b s✝ j k * c s✝ k'✝ i'✝ * z (i'✝, j'✝, k'✝)"],"goals":[[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],[0,1,2,3,4,5,8,9],[0,1,2,3,4,5,8,10],[0,1,2,3,4,5,8,11],[0,1,2,3,4,5,8,12],